            <th>File Size (Bytes)</th>
            <th>Size Reduction vs PNG</th>
            <th>Encoding Time (RAM)</th>
            <th>PSNR Fidelity</th>
            <th>Browser Support</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Uncompressed 24-bit RGB</strong></td>
            <td>36,578,304 B (34.8 MB)</td>
            <td>Baseline (Raw Pixels)</td>
            <td>Instantaneous</td>
            <td>Infinity (Perfect)</td>
            <td>Internal Buffer</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
